WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:13,050
What a fierce fish

2
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,620
Just wipe it all. Don't stop.

3
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,300
Keep digging for me

4
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,490
Who dares to take half a step back?

5
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:36,820
I'll let her go now. It's so sweet. Eat slowly.

6
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,780
No one will rob you

7
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:42,070
Pick a bottle of fresh lunchtime snacks and follow your orders

8
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:58,180
Little girl cheats and eats

9
00:00:58,460 --> 00:00:59,780
It’s simply a blast.
